  "question": {
    "text": "For any vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, consider the following statements:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>max</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math> : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>",
